# Operational Cash Notes & Daily Diary Feature (Knowledge Record Only)

## Background & Objectives
The user requested a **"Note / Cash Memo"** feature accessible to **Admin**, **Manager**, and **Accounting** roles.
- **Primary Goal**: Allow authorized staff to record cash transactions (e.g., cash received from customers, cash payouts for land acquisitions, site expenses, cash handovers) and operational reminders with date, time, party name, and notes.
- **CRITICAL REQUIREMENT**: **Strictly NO system financial calculations**. Entries in this notebook must **never** touch corporate treasury balance, customer ledger accounts, double-entry journals, wallets, or financial statements. It serves strictly as a **knowledge record / operational memory log** (yaad-dahani).
- **Core Principle**: Existing accounting, treasury, billing, customer, and wallet business logic remains **100% untouched and unchanged**.
- **UI Design**: Seamlessly integrated into `Admin Hub`, `Accounting Hub`, and `Operations Hub` (Manager) with matching design aesthetics, badges, filters, and modals.

