## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Complete Financial Isolation Guarantee**:
> Records saved in this feature are stored in a dedicated `OperationalNote` table. No triggers, hooks, or journal line postings are attached to this model. System treasury balances, customer receivables, and general ledgers remain completely decoupled and untouched.

> [!NOTE]
