## Proposed Changes

### 1. Database Schema Layer
#### [MODIFY] [backend/prisma/schema.prisma](file:///d:/EstateSync/backend/prisma/schema.prisma)
Add a standalone `OperationalNote` model:
```prisma
model OperationalNote {
  id            String    @id @default(uuid())
  title         String
  category      String    // CASH_RECEIVED_CUSTOMER, CASH_PAID_LAND, CASH_PAID_EXPENSE, CASH_HANDOVER, GENERAL_NOTE, OTHER
  partyName     String?   // Customer, Landowner, Vendor, Staff name
  amount        Decimal?  @db.Decimal(15, 2) @default(0) // Purely informational reference, never posted to ledgers
  referenceNo   String?   // Receipt No, Plot No, Voucher No, Contact
  description   String?   // Detailed remarks / notes
  noteDate      DateTime  @default(now()) // Transaction / note date-time
  createdById   String
  createdByName String?
  createdByRole String?
  createdAt     DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt     DateTime  @updatedAt

  @@index([noteDate])
  @@index([category])
  @@index([createdById])
}
```
Run `npx prisma db push` and `npx prisma generate` to create the table in PostgreSQL without affecting any existing tables.

